# osHostLiveGameplay() for the host autoplay driver: nonzero only while the
# ball is live (GS_GAMEPLAY or GS_OVERTIME, game not over).
# OPENSTRIKERS_AUTOPLAY plays at random only then; outside live play it waits
# and taps A, which steps through the summary and takes Rematch. Random input
# in the menus wandered off -- quit to the main menu, into Strikers 101 --
# instead of playing the next match.
